{
  "id": 8860456550599,
  "title": "Personalized Girl Messy Bun Reading Book and Holding Mug Throw Blanket",
  "handle": "personalized-girl-messy-bun-reading-book-and-holding-mug-throw-blanket",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in comfort with our personalized Book Lover Blanket, a thoughtful and unique throw designed specifically for those who cherish their reading moments. This cozy blanket from Jeminise is perfect for adding warmth and style to any book lover’s nook, making every reading session even more delightful.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Gift for Book Lovers:</strong> A personal and cherished gift that highlights a love for reading, ideal for any bibliophile.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize your blanket with unique details like skin color, hairstyle, and name to create a truly one-of-a-kind item.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to find your perfect cozy fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Perfect Gift Idea:</strong> An excellent gift for book lovers on birthdays, Christmas, or as a heartfelt surprise for fellow readers.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort and Style:</strong> This beautifully designed and personalized blanket offers both warmth and a touch of elegance to your reading space.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for convenience, this blanket is machine washable, ensuring easy maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from durable polyester, providing a lightweight yet comforting feel.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>40x30, 50x40, 60x50, 80x60 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Age Range Description</th>\n<td>Adult</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
